WEBVTT

00:33:57.758 --> 00:34:00.716
and shift our attention
to an exciting purpose.

00:34:00.740 --> 00:34:02.336
The farther ahead we look,

00:34:02.360 --> 00:34:04.676
the easier it becomes
to tell a coherent story

00:34:04.700 --> 00:34:06.736
about our experience.

00:34:06.760 --> 00:34:08.856
One of the challenges
of the current pandemic

00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:11.317
is that we don't know
when our mission will end,

00:34:11.341 --> 00:34:13.675
but we do know it isn't endless.

00:34:13.699 --> 00:34:14.932
It will end.

00:34:16.000 --> 00:34:17.667
So think about how you want to feel

00:34:17.691 --> 00:34:19.896
on the day this crisis is over.

00:34:19.920 --> 00:34:22.020
How will you want to have gone through it?

00:34:22.950 --> 00:34:26.676
You might still find yourself worrying
about what will happen in between.

00:34:26.700 --> 00:34:28.470
It's inevitable.

00:34:28.494 --> 00:34:29.806
But here's the thing:

00:34:29.830 --> 00:34:32.296
worrying isn't necessarily a bad thing.